# ONhost edge — the Slovak domain (W6-6, owner decision 2026-10-16), Caddy flavour.
# The Slovak public site lives at https://onhost.cz/sk/ on the same domain; onhost.sk only redirects there, permanently (301),
# keeping the path and the query ({uri} = path + query). The target host is fixed: never the request host, so the redirect cannot be
# pointed elsewhere. Import this file from conf.d next to the main Caddyfile; DNS and deployment are the owner's steps
# (docs/runbooks/sk-cutover.md).

onhost.sk, www.onhost.sk {
    redir https://onhost.cz/sk{uri} 301
}
